Data attribution
================================================================================

This package bundles snapshots of publicly-available open data from
Canadian and US government data portals. The wrapper code in this package
is AGPL-3.0-or-later; the bundled data files themselves are under each
portal's own open-data license (Open Government Licence, Creative Commons
attribution variants, public domain), as documented in per-file headers
inside inst/extdata/.
